# Unit24
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit24核心词汇

loss/lɒs/损失/The company suffered a great financial loss.
lot/lɒt/许多/There are a lot of books on the shelf.
loud/laʊd/大声的/Don't speak so loud in the library.
love/lʌv/爱/She has a great love for music.
lovely/ˈlʌvli/可爱的/What a lovely day!
low/loʊ/低的/The temperature is very low today.
loyal/ˈlɔɪəl/忠诚的/He is a loyal friend.
luck/lʌk/运气/Good luck with your exam!
luggage/ˈlʌɡɪdʒ/行李/Please collect your luggage at the airport.
lunch/lʌntʃ/午餐/We had lunch at a nearby restaurant.
lung/lʌŋ/肺/Smoking damages your lungs.
luxury/ˈlʌkʃəri/奢侈/He lives in luxury.
machine/məˈʃiːn/机器/The machine is running smoothly.
mad/mæd/疯狂的；生气的/She was mad at him for breaking the promise.
magazine/ˌmæɡəˈziːn/杂志/She reads a fashion magazine every month.
magic/ˈmædʒɪk/魔术；魔法/The magician performed amazing magic tricks.
magnificent/mæɡˈnɪfɪsnt/壮丽的/The view from the mountaintop is magnificent.
mail/meɪl/邮件/I received an important mail today.
main/meɪn/主要的/What is the main reason for your decision?
maintain/meɪnˈteɪn/维持；维护/We must maintain a healthy lifestyle.
major/ˈmeɪdʒər/主要的；专业/English is her major at university.
majority/məˈdʒɔːrəti/多数/The majority of students passed the exam.
make/meɪk/制造/She makes delicious cakes.
male/meɪl/男性的/The male population accounts for half of the total.
manage/ˈmænɪdʒ/管理/She manages a team of 20 people.
manifest/ˈmænɪfest/表明；清单/The symptoms manifested themselves quickly.
manner/ˈmænər/方式；礼貌/He has a polite manner.
manufacture/ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər/制造/The company manufactures electronic products.
many/ˈmeni/许多/Many people attended the conference.
march/mɑːrtʃ/行进；三月/The soldiers marched through the city.
margin/ˈmɑːrdʒɪn/边缘；利润/The company's profit margins are very thin.
mark/mɑːrk/标记；分数/She got high marks in the exam.
market/ˈmɑːrkɪt/市场/The stock market crashed yesterday.
marriage/ˈmærɪdʒ/婚姻/They have a happy marriage.
marry/ˈmæri/结婚/They got married last summer.
mass/mæs/大量；质量/A mass of people gathered in the square.
master/ˈmæstər/掌握；主人/She has mastered three foreign languages.
match/mætʃ/比赛；匹配/The football match was very exciting.
mate/meɪt/伙伴/He is my classmate and best mate.
material/məˈtɪriəl/材料/We need more raw materials for production.
matter/ˈmætər/事情；要紧/It doesn't matter if you're a little late.
mature/məˈtʃʊr/成熟的/He is mature enough to make his own decisions.
maximum/ˈmæksɪməm/最大值/The maximum speed on this road is 120 km/h.
mean/miːn/意味着/What does this word mean?
means/miːnz/手段；方式/A car is a convenient means of transport.
measure/ˈmeʒər/测量/We need to measure the length of the room.
meat/miːt/肉/We had roast meat for dinner.
mechanism/ˈmekənɪzəm/机制/The government introduced a new feedback mechanism.
media/ˈmiːdiə/媒体/Social media has changed how we communicate.
medical/ˈmedɪkl/医学的/She is receiving medical treatment.
medicine/ˈmedɪsn/医学；药/Take the medicine three times a day.
